;
; How Talewind files a choice, an edge of a story graph, in MYRA
; (talewind_rules.h TR5): its story, the passage it leaves, its place among
; that passage's choices, the passage it leads to, the flags it needs and
; the flags it sets (each a mask of 16 flags).
^ZXTALECH(story:i6, passage:i2, choice:i1) = target:i2! ^ need:i5! ^ sets:i5!
